<title>POLAND: Polfa Kutno to contest tax arrears.</title>
<headline>Polfa Kutno to contest tax arrears.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish drug maker Polfa Kutno SA, which has 7.1 million zlotys in tax arrears to local authorities, will contest the claim at a higher regional tax court, the firm's president said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Tomorrow (Friday) we'll apply to the tax office in Plock (central Poland) to call off the affair,&quot; Wiktor Tomusiak told Reuters.</p>
<p>Polfa Kutno owes the tax authorities 1.37 million zlotys in overvdue VAT taxes and 5.75 million zlotys owing to a lifting of investment tax breaks in 1995 and 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
